{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-cli/src/client.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:29:16.162549Z","id":"3c81987e19ed5a7dda47f118abaf0ac21e6251622c1fae7ad495f0dcf003cce5","body":{"detail":"On 2026-10-13, `cargo nextest run --workspace --no-fail-fast` (2516 tests) failed it after 7.3 s, panicking at crates/clax-cli/src/client.rs:1860; `cargo nextest run -E 'test(/a_slow_start_that_reports/)'` passed it at once. It looks load-sensitive: the test may be waiting on a wall-clock budget rather than a condition (AGENTS.md: no wall-clock budgets in functional tests).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":1845},"end":{"line":1864},"content_hash":"2b4e2fb3dc14e454fbdfeca42057c40289ed34940df206b71aeca22f536a1fbd"},"summary":"a_slow_start_that_reports_progress_is_waited_for_and_not_rolled_back failed once under the whole workspace's nextest run and passed alone","tags":["tests","flaky","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-cli/src/client.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:09:20.427581Z","id":"8b3b8c7ed19c8adb7b34f837868ad70ed646a7d393dcae820417ab75f6842b85","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:509b1cb5","summary":"Fixed in 509b1cb5: the test's windows were 3 s to the first report and 1 s between reports, which a loaded machine's Python stand-in missed; they are now 5 s and 5 s, and the stand-in reports for 6 s, still past the start window. cargo test -p clax-cli a_slow_start: 1 passed (7.25 s) at a load average of about 37.","supersedes":"3c81987e19ed5a7dda47f118abaf0ac21e6251622c1fae7ad495f0dcf003cce5","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-cli/src/serve.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-27T02:27:30.517174Z","id":"88694a26166cb14fa65f067d6df7678e03d652dc66710a2b07e4cb7ac422708c","body":{"detail":"serve.rs:44-46 turns the quickstart on when HomeConfig::load(home.root()) errs (unwrap_or(true)), so a home whose config is unreadable seeds although its owner may have switched it off, and nothing says why. Log the error at warn, or fail the start.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":44},"end":{"line":46},"content_hash":"aa5f46f7be51745f3e92d12419f8eff0c01f8739b1d8274d6eba741d13ad3a5b"},"summary":"gallery_quickstart defaults to on when HomeConfig::load fails, without logging the error","tags":["review","session:claude-code:e18aa7d7-bdd7-42c6-a52e-16a9153256f7"]}}
